msgctxt "64"
msgid "Kiryu. This boy has quite the fire in his belly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid "I'm sorry for how he's acting. He doesn't usually do this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "Well? Let's hear it, old man! Tell me what you think!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"It's a fine work, yes. Not only does its technique impress, but I can tell "
"the original artist truly cared about both you and this tattoo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid ""
"Damn right he did! So what do you say? You gonna finish the job for me!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "Please forgive me. I'm afraid I just can't do it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "Huh? But why not!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"Your artist did an exquisite job on this piece, there's no doubt about that."
" But as I said, both the tattoo's creator and receiver must be prepared to "
"bear the responsibility it brings."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "Ugh, not this crap again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"I don't know you. I don't know your ambitions, and I don't know why you've "
"chosen to carry that tattoo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid ""
"As long as those things remain a mystery to me, I cannot do what you ask."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "Pfft. Stubborn old shit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "Watch it, Rikiya."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "My apologies, but I'm going to have to ask you to leave now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "Right. Sorry we barged in on you like this. Come on, Rikiya. Let's go."
msgstr ""

